            "name": "List Auto Scaling Configurations",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Returns a list of active App Runner automatic scaling configurations in your Amazon Web Services account. You can query the revisions for a specific configuration name or the revisions for all active configurations in your account. You can optionally query only the latest revision of each requested name.</p> <p>To retrieve a full description of a particular configuration revision, call and provide one of the ARNs returned by <code>ListAutoScalingConfigurations</code>.</p>",
